# .cbmignore - FastPrompter
# Drop this in V:\___VAC\__K\__CODE\_PY\_FastPrompter\.cbmignore BEFORE indexing.
#
# WHY: the repo is 1.7 GB, but the real source is only ~175k LOC across ~300
# files. Without this file the graph is ~95% noise:
#
#   .claude/      1,393 .py files (328 MB)  <- MORE python than src/ itself
#   .venv/        1,364 .py files (344 MB)
#   data/        25,910 .md files ( 97 MB)
#   build/                        (638 MB)
#
# Measured: src/ alone indexes in 16.4s -> 2,874 nodes / 15,400 edges
# (6,452 CALLS). That is the graph you want. Indexing the rest buys nothing.

# ---- agent + tooling state ----------------------------------------------
.claude/
.codenomad/
.freebuff/
.saipen/
.saiwork/
.workbuddy-ai/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
__pycache__/

# ---- environment ---------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
site-packages/

# ---- build output --------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.spec
*.pyc
*.pyd
*.dll
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp

# ---- bulk data -----------------------------------------------------------
data/
_res/
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.png
*.jpg
*.svg
*.ico
*.db
*.sqlite
*.tmp-wal
*.tmp-shm

# ---- docs (keep src/ docstrings, skip the prose) -------------------------
# docs/
# CHANGELOG.md
